WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.328
This is DiViet, running for real on a phone.

00:00:05.534 --> 00:00:07.597
Pick one of five languages.

00:00:07.597 --> 00:00:08.598
No account needed.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:13.150
Explore 269 heritage sites,

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:15.952
with photos, maps and timelines.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:18.959
Near me maps the sites around you.

00:00:18.959 --> 00:00:20.883
Your location is never stored.

00:00:22.033 --> 00:00:24.211
Each site has its own page:

00:00:24.211 --> 00:00:25.998
introduction, photos,

00:00:25.998 --> 00:00:27.208
facts and sources.

00:00:28.267 --> 00:00:30.936
Read a summary or listen to the audio guide,

00:00:30.936 --> 00:00:32.112
in your own language.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.239
Where there's a 3D model,

00:00:35.239 --> 00:00:37.247
rotate it and see every side.

00:00:38.533 --> 00:00:40.795
A timeline tells each site's story,

00:00:40.795 --> 00:00:41.971
period by period.

00:00:43.067 --> 00:00:44.930
Get suggestions from what you've viewed,

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:47.018
and clear your history any time.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:50.145
Every page cites its sources,

00:00:50.145 --> 00:00:52.247
from the Department of Cultural Heritage.

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:56.250
In schools, AI drafts lessons for the class

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:58.787
level; teachers review before publishing.

00:00:59.568 --> 00:01:02.218
Students enter a lesson code and learn at

00:01:02.218 --> 00:01:03.088
their own level.
